hl.intro.1=§8[???]§r §7This world is not as empty as it looks. Every day you stay, something else notices you're here.
hl.intro.2=§8[???]§r §7Read the §fJournal§7. Craft a §fFlashlight§7 and §fBatteries§7. A §fWard Lantern§7 keeps your home safe... mostly.
hl.act.n=Act %s
hl.act.1.name=Visitors
hl.act.1.intro=§8[???]§r §7You're alone in this world. Aren't you?
hl.act.1.text=First, sounds that aren't there: footsteps, doors, your name. Now they come from somewhere: you will hear which side.\n\nThen the visitors come. §fHerobrineGamer788§r joins your game. Underground, the §fCave Dweller§r stalks you. In the field, a §fnameless villager§r watches you. And far below, under the deepslate, there is an §3Ancient City§r where nobody makes a sound.\n\nEveryone has their fears, and the game knows them.
hl.act.2.name=The Woods
hl.act.2.intro=§8[???]§r §7Don't look out of the window at night.
hl.act.2.text=§fHerobrine§r watches you with his tail of vertebrae. A §ffaceless Enderman§r blinks around you. The §ffog§r rolls in and, in it, a man in a raincoat. Someone knocks on your door with your voice. You find §fyour own grave§r. And at three in the morning, everything looks at you.
hl.act.3.name=The Error
hl.act.3.intro=§8[???]§r §7Something has broken in the code.
hl.act.3.text=§fnull§r corrupts the world. §fEntity 303§r joins your game and plays with it.\n\nEvery four days, the §4Red Night§r.\n\nIf you have found all seven pages, you know how to end this.
