hl.lore.nameless=§lThe Nameless Villager§r\n§8(inspired by Minecraft villager creepypastas)§r\n\nEvery villager has a job and a name. This one has neither. It stands in the fields at the edge of what you can see, in an ash-grey robe, arms hanging to its knees, head tipped too far. The eyes are two white holes. It hums, low and slow, from where it stands. If you don't look, it comes closer. If you look, it stands still and after a while lifts an arm and points at you. If it gets behind you, it puts a hand on your shoulder.\n\n§eTip:§r keep it in sight, or walk up to it: it vanishes. The flashlight scares it off too.
hl.lore.faceless=§lThe Faceless Enderman§r\n§8(inspired by Enderman creepypastas)§r\n\nAn Enderman taller than the ones in the game, with no face: only a violet line where the eyes would be. It doesn't walk: it blinks. You hear it vanish from one place and arrive at another, in 3D, so you know which way it went. Every time it is closer. Look straight at it and the line opens, and it comes for you.\n\n§eTip:§r listen. A light sends it away.
