hl.lore.steps=§lFootsteps§r\n\nSomeone walks behind you, step for step. When you walk, they walk; when you stop, they stop. But every time you stop they take one more step, a little closer. Turn round and there is nobody.
hl.lore.countdown=§lThe Countdown§r\n\nA message from nobody: "When it reaches zero, turn around." Then the numbers, one a second. At zero the screen goes black, and when it comes back there is a face in front of yours. Or sometimes nothing... and a minute later, a scream.
hl.lore.grave=§lYour Grave§r\n\nAt night, a bell behind you. Go and look: a mound of freshly dug earth, a headstone, a black rose, and on the stone your name and tomorrow's date. Come close and something knocks. From underneath.
hl.lore.hour=§lThe Dead Hour§r\n\nThree in the morning. Every animal and villager around you stops where it is and turns to look at you, all at once, while a bell nobody owns tolls three times. Then they carry on as if nothing happened. And far away, someone screams.
